1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:05,751
Embassy Bancorp's third quarter:
fastest profit growth of three
Pennsylvania banks.

2
00:00:06,301 --> 00:00:10,068
Earnings rose thirty-two percent to
sixty-six cents a share.

3
00:00:10,618 --> 00:00:14,349
Net income rose twenty-eight
percent, the fastest of the three.

4
00:00:14,899 --> 00:00:18,715
But its margin, two point eight four
percent, is still the thinnest.

5
00:00:19,265 --> 00:00:25,082
And unrealized securities losses of
sixty-six million dollars cut equity
almost eight percent.

6
00:00:25,632 --> 00:00:28,025
Fast growth, on a thin margin.

